@startuml
title Change2 - upgrade uses active-reservation availability
class RoomUpgrade {
  initialize(booking, target_room)
  call()
  available?()
  price_difference()
}
class Booking {
  {static} active()
  room
  upgraded_from_room
  canceled?()
}
class Room {
  day_price
  booked_dates()
}
RoomUpgrade --> Booking : lock / reject canceled / save
RoomUpgrade --> Room : target lock / active overlap query
Booking --> Room : current and first original room
note bottom of RoomUpgrade
  Difference = (target.day_price - current.day_price) * nights.
  Booking.active is introduced here, before Strategy.
  Half-open date intervals allow adjacent stays.
  Source: checkpoints/Change2/app/services/room_upgrade.rb
end note
@enduml
